### use-case: thermostat

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    a_temp_sensor["temp_sensor (device)"]
    a_tick["tick (timer)"]
    a_user["user (human)"]
    subgraph sys_thermostat["thermostat"]
        g_tick_control_loop(["tick.control_loop"])
        g_tick_telemetry(["tick.telemetry"])
        g_user_set_target(["user.set_target"])
        s_control_loop["scenario control_loop"]
    end
    a_tick --> g_tick_control_loop
    a_tick --> g_tick_telemetry
    a_user --> g_user_set_target
    s_control_loop -.->|"realizes"| g_tick_control_loop
```

### sequence: thermostat.control_loop

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    title control_loop
    participant system as system
    participant temp_sensor as temp_sensor
    participant tick as tick
    Note over tick: tick.fires
    tick->>temp_sensor: temp_sensor.signals_sample
    temp_sensor-->>system: system.computes_duty
    system->>system: system.drives_heater
    alt ok
        Note over system: end ok
    else overcurrent
        Note over system: system.trips_safety
        Note over system: end err(overcurrent)
    end
    alt crc_error
        loop retry max 2
            temp_sensor-->>temp_sensor: temp_sensor.signals_sample
        end
        opt retries exhausted
            Note over system: system.holds_last_duty
            Note over system: end ok
        end
    else timeout
        Note over system: system.holds_last_duty
        Note over system: end ok
    end
```

### activity: thermostat.control_loop

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    start(("control_loop"))
    n0["tick.fires"]
    start --> n0
    n1["temp_sensor.signals_sample"]
    n0 --> n1
    n2["system.computes_duty"]
    n1 -->|"try"| n2
    n3["system.drives_heater"]
    n2 --> n3
    t0(["end ok"])
    n3 -->|"ok"| t0
    n4["system.trips_safety"]
    n3 -->|"overcurrent"| n4
    t1(["end err(overcurrent)"])
    n4 --> t1
    n1 -->|"crc_error, retry max 2"| n1
    n5["system.holds_last_duty"]
    n1 -->|"retries exhausted"| n5
    t2(["end ok"])
    n5 --> t2
    n1 -->|"timeout"| n5
    t3(["end ok"])
    n5 --> t3
```
